We are proud to share that Miggo has joined the Wiz Integration Network (WIN), an open security ecosystem redefining cloud and AI security collaboration.


Through its integration with Wiz, now part of Google Cloud, Miggo brings the power of Miggo WAF Copilot to the WIN ecosystem, giving customers a comprehensive, actionable view of risk. This partnership delivers:


- ‍ **Mitigation in minutes, while waiting on a patch:** Miggo WAF Copilot turns Critical and High Wiz findings on internet-facing workloads into deployable, CVE-specific WAF rules, increasing coverage by[over 91%](https://www.miggo.io/post/new-report-beat-the-bypass-why-52-of-vulnerabilities-slip-past-the-waf-and-how-ai-augmentation-fixes-it) . **‍**
- **Protection through the WAF customers already run:** Rules deploy to existing AWS WAF, Cloudflare, Akamai and F5 infrastructure — no new inline agents, no code changes and no downtime. **‍**
- **Mitigation that stays in sync with posture:** A read-only integration syncs Wiz findings every 24 hours, and mitigations retire automatically when Wiz marks a finding resolved or rejected.


The combined value of these two offerings streamlines security for organizations, no matter where they are in their cloud and AI journey. By sharing prioritized security findings with context, customers gain a unified, actionable view of risk.


“Exploitation now routinely arrives before the patch does, and posture alone cannot close that gap,” said Itai Goldman, CTO & Co-Founder of Miggo Security. “Wiz tells security teams what is exposed and why it matters; Miggo makes it unexploitable. Together, we give customers protection in minutes and give engineers the time to ship permanent fixes on their own schedule.”


"We're happy to welcome Miggo Security to the WIN ecosystem," said Oron Noah, VP of Product, Extensibility and Partnerships at Wiz. "By connecting Wiz's prioritized risk findings with Miggo's autonomous mitigation, joint customers can mitigate critical risks right away without disrupting engineering workflows.”


WIN is designed to support a new operating model for cloud and AI-era security. This partnership strengthens the WIN ecosystem, delivering greater value to customers who rely on Wiz’s open security platform and Miggo to secure their cloud and AI environments.


To learn more about this collaboration and how your organization can be better protected,[talk to us!](https://miggo-staging.webflow.io/book-a-demo)


